atforms": [130], "player_perspectives": [{"id": 2, "name": "Third person"}, {"id": 3, "name": "Bird view / Isometric"}], "rating": 78.15261148638018, "release_dates": [{"id": 586500, "date": 1583452800, "platform": 130, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 351115, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7ix7.jpg"}, {"id": 351114, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7ix6.jpg"}, {"id": 351113, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7ix5.jpg"}, {"id": 351112, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7ix4.jpg"}, {"id": 351111, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc7ix3.jpg"}], "slug": "pokemon-mystery-dungeon-rescue-team-dx", "storyline": "In a world inhabited entirely by talking Pok\u00e9mon, some living in bustling towns and others dwelling in the wild, one ordinary day takes a strange turn. The player awakens as a Pok\u00e9mon with a jarring case of amnesia, remembering only that they were once a human. This revelation stuns everyone they meet, for while the Pok\u00e9mon know of a distant human world, it is meant to remain forever apart from their own. Befriending a kindhearted partner Pok\u00e9mon, the pair form a rescue team dedicated to helping others in trouble, braving ever-shifting mystery dungeons to save Pok\u00e9mon lost, trapped, or in danger. Their calling has never been more urgent, as violent natural disasters strike the land with growing frequency and force. As the team takes on missions, builds its reputation, and crosses paths with rival squads, whispers of an ancient legend begin to swirl, hinting that the newcomer's arrival may be tied to the chaos.", "summary": "You can meet and recruit Pok\u00e9mon in a dungeon-crawling adventure within their world! Build a rescue team to take on mysterious, changing dungeons and strategically plan your moves as you venture forth to make the Pok\u00e9mon world a safer place\u2026and uncover your true purpose along the way.\n\nAs you recruit Pok\u00e9mon, these trusty teammates will need somewhere to stay, so build camps to house, manage, and strengthen your Pok\u00e9mon friends. Think hard about who is right for the job and how to approach each mysterious dungeon as you prepare a rescue team. You\u2019ll move a single square at a time or use Auto mode to speed up movement until you engage other Pok\u00e9mon in turn-based battles\u2014but don\u2019t forget about Pok\u00e9mon strengths and weaknesses! This version adds gorgeous watercolor-inspired graphics, and more! Get comfortable in being a Pok\u00e9mon, there\u2019s a lot of work to do.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pokemon-mystery-dungeon-rescue-team-dx", "videos": [{"id": 32932, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "2R_1HEbxYhA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2R_1HEbxYhA", "title": "Pok\u00e9mon Mystery Dungeon: Rescue Team DX\u2014Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2R_1HEbxYhA/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 472, "name": "Pok\u00e9mon Mystery Dungeon"}]}